{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/8ab196230224c4ccd6802cd514bc3dac.avif?t=1759352949\" width=1410 height=912 /></span>Somethin isn't right. Whispers linger in the quiet, and the air feels heavier that it should. Beware, that what comes to light may not willingly return to the darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is a gamble. No second chances, The path ahead is treacherous and ever-changing. You may seek to save yourself, perhaps even others. But beware, the deeper you delve, the greater the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the curse, or find your\u00a0Sepulcher within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Souls-inspired, Permadeath, Roguelike dungeon crawler, where every room is filled with the swarming Undead, and every run is a new layout. Fight for your life as the only goal is to break the curse at the bottom of this accursed land, or die trying.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054980?t=1759352949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/14b0fd6ee7ca356f7c5301d162f5dfe2fb4b6efb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759352949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/97215e040f8bd00b0fa45299569fad86c0a9a343/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759352949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/97215e040f8bd00b0fa45299569fad86c0a9a343/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759352949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/8ab196230224c4ccd6802cd514bc3dac.avif?t=1759352949\" width=1410 height=912 /></span>Somethin isn't right. Whispers linger in the quiet, and the air feels heavier that it should. Beware, that what comes to light may not willingly return to the darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is a gamble. No second chances, The path ahead is treacherous and ever-changing. You may seek to save yourself, perhaps even others. But beware, the deeper you delve, the greater the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the curse, or find your\u00a0Sepulcher within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Souls-inspired, Permadeath, Roguelike dungeon crawler, where every room is filled with the swarming Undead, and every run is a new layout. Fight for your life as the only goal is to break the curse at the bottom of this accursed land, or die trying.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Laughing Cat Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/f5f8bab92e7822a5b457824a778d61376852a074/header.jpg?t=1759352949","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Laughing Cat Studios Ltd., All Rights reserved 2025.<br />\r\nNo Generative AI was used in the designing, scripting, or coding of this product. ","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Sepulcher","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Laughing Cat Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_